            <p>Traveling by train from Alexandria to Richmond offers a relaxing alternative to driving or flying, especially if you value comfort, scenic views, and arrival in the city center. Even though driving may seem faster on paper, I-95 congestion often makes the train the smarter choice. The route's direct service makes it beginner-friendly for first-time travelers. </p>
