            <p> <b> Comfort: </b>  Spacious seats, Wi-Fi, power outlets, café car</p>
            <p> <b> Flexibility: </b>  Direct city-center to city-center service, 4-6 departures per day</p>
            <p> <b> Pros: </b> Scenic views, no traffic stress, productive travel time, multiple Richmond station options</p>
