            <h3>Bus</h3>
            <p> <b> Duration: </b>  ~2h30 - 4h00 depending on traffic (Greyhound, FlixBus, Megabus) </p>
            <p> <b> Comfort: </b>   Standard coach seating; fewer amenities than a train</p>
            <p> <b> Flexibility: </b>  Multiple departures per day, pick-up/drop-off at various points</p>
