            <p> <b> Cons: </b>  Slower in heavy I-95 traffic, less comfortable, limited space for luggage, unpredictable delays</p>
            <h3>Flight</h3>
            <p> <b> Duration: </b>  ~0h45 air time, but the total journey often is 3-4 hours, including airport procedures. </p>
